## Development defaults

These rules apply to this code project. Keep AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md to rules; the detail lives in docs/agents/README.md.

- Review every pull request with an AI code review and a security review, for example `/code-review` and `/security-review` or a reviewer agent. Fix the findings and review again. Merge only when the reviews are clean and CI is green, and record the review on the pull request. See docs/agents/pull-requests.md.
- Read docs/map/README.md before a broad search of the code. The optional code map is built only with this project's own pinned runtime under .local/tools/, never with a global install.
- Install Claude Code plugins only with the commands in docs/agents/claude-plugins.md, after checking them against your own vetting log. Nothing installs them silently, and no secret belongs in project files.
